# Dataset payload — keep folder structure but never commit the documents.
# Cedant claim PDFs contain insured names, ref numbers, and amounts that
# we do NOT want in git history.
*.pdf
*.PDF
*.png
*.jpg
*.jpeg
*.xlsx
*.xls
*.csv
*.json

# Allow the folder skeleton + this file + the README.
!.gitkeep
!.gitignore
!README.md
